## Interface: 16001
## Title: Dufforth Tweaks Helper
## Notes: Gathering, disenchanting and crafting help. Keeps herb and ore icons on the minimap, swaps tracking, says in item tooltips whether to disenchant, sell on the auction house or sell to a vendor, disenchants BoE gear one click at a time, recommends gear worth crafting to disenchant, plans the cheapest way to level a profession, keeps a one-button warrior macro up to date, recommends consumables and gear upgrades for your class, and says what's worth doing in your zone.
